1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,730
Ana needs to pass along a location. When she leaves the title empty, the web app tells her which field to fix.

2
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:13,980
Ana leaves a handoff for the next shift. The web app saves her note and returns a reference.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,980
After a reload, Ana enters the reference and gets back the original handoff.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,980
Bob tries the same reference. The service hides the note and tells him it was not found.

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:32,897
The command-line client creates a second note. Ana reads it back. Bob gets the same refusal.

6
00:00:32,917 --> 00:00:39,730
Ana opens the reference printed by the command-line client. The browser shows the same title and body.

7
00:00:39,750 --> 00:00:49,480
The interactive terminal opens that second note for Ana. Switching to Bob keeps its contents private.
